# ACSA Code UI Design System Rules

You are modifying the ACSA Code modern AI IDE workbench codebase.
You MUST strictly adhere to the established design system tokens, concentric geometry, and iconography guidelines.

## 1. Design Token System
- Use the 3-tier CSS tokens declared under `src/styles/tokens/`:
  - Primitives (`primitives.css`): Apple Obsidian Dark Slate palette, 4px grid (`--space-1` to `--space-12`), concentric radii, dual-layer shadows.
  - Semantics (`semantics.css`): `bg-canvas`, `bg-workbench`, `bg-overlay`, `bg-modal`, `border-hairline`, `border-subtle`.
  - Components (`components.css`): composite dimensions for titlebar pills, dropdowns, and modals.
- Never use arbitrary hex colors for core surfaces or borders; use `bg-canvas`, `bg-workbench`, `bg-overlay`, `border-hairline`, etc.

## 2. Mathematical Concentric Curvature & Active State Standards
- Law of Concentric Geometry: R_outer = R_inner + Padding.
- In dropdowns with 12px outer radius (`rounded-dropdown`) and 4px padding (`p-1`), inner selectable items MUST be 8px (`rounded-[8px]`).
- In modal dialogs with 16px outer radius (`rounded-modal`), inner child cards MUST be 10px (`rounded-card`) when the padding is 6px, or 8px (`rounded-[8px]`) when the padding is 8px. Do not rely on `rounded-md` or `rounded-lg`; Tailwind's defaults are 6px and 8px.
- NEVER use one-sided borders (`border-l-`, `border-r-`, `border-t-`, `border-b-`) to indicate active, selected, or highlighted items. Use background surface fills (e.g., `bg-white/[0.08]`) with rounded corners.

## 3. Lucide React Iconography Exclusively
- Do NOT use `hugeicons-react`, `@vscode/codicons` (uninstalled) or arbitrary SVG icons.
- Import lucide icons directly or from `src/components/ui/Icon.tsx` (1.5px stroke weight).
- Use standardized size tokens: `xs` (12px), `sm` (14px), `md` (16px), `lg` (20px), `xl` (24px), or raw number.

## 4. Official Brand Logos & Tech Tools
- Authentic unaltered official SVG vectors are stored in `public/logos/<provider>.svg` and `public/logos/tech/<tool>.svg`.
- Use `src/components/ui/BrandLogos.tsx` for AI models/providers and `src/components/ui/TechLogos.tsx` / `src/components/ui/FileIcon.tsx` for languages and tools.
- Never hand-approximate proprietary brand marks or modify them into custom SVGs.

## 5. Universal 5-Glyph Lifecycle Taxonomy
- Use `src/components/ui/StatusGlyph.tsx` (`<StatusGlyph status="..." />` or `<StatusChip status="..." />`):
  - `success`: Emerald Checkmark (#10b981) — Completed, healthy, passed, synced
  - `in-progress`: Sky Clock (#0284c7) — Active, running, building, pulling
  - `needs-action`: Magenta Pie (#d946ef) — Requires review, unstaged diff, conflict
  - `pending`: Amber Crescent (#f59e0b) — Queued, behind remote, waiting
  - `open`: Gray Dashed Ring (#71717a) — Idle, empty, unassigned, clean
